# Layering

Read [`skills/layering/SKILL.md`](../skills/layering/SKILL.md) before editing Motoko.

- Calls flow **downward only**: `api/v1/` → `services/` → `repositories/` → `storage/`
- No business logic in API or repositories
- No storage access from API
- Fund paths use `caller`, never a user-supplied sender principal
- New endpoint → service + test in the same change
